# <type>(<scope>): <intent — why, not what>
#
# Body: constraints, approach rationale (wrap at 100 chars)
#
# --- Trailers (all optional except Assisted-by for AI commits) ---
# Constraint: <external constraint that shaped the decision>
# Rejected: <alternative> | <reason>
# Confidence: low|medium|high
# Scope-risk: narrow|moderate|broad
# Directive: <warning for future modifiers>
# Tested: <what was verified>
# Not-tested: <known verification gaps>
# Assisted-by: <Model> with <Tool>
#
# Types: feat fix docs chore refactor test perf ci style
# Subject: imperative, ≤70 chars, no period. ! before : for breaking.
# Lines: ≤100 chars. One concern per commit.
